      "value": "Apparently using multiple clients all logged into the same account works, but using all different accounts does not. Tested with the deferred events test world that has a single button to fire 256 always buffer ones. With all the same account, clicking the button and rejoining the world results in 96 triggers buffering and the rest doing nothing. (https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/buffered-triggers-fail-to-buffer). With 3 different accounts, having one player click the button and leaving causes all late joiners to see no buffered events as this post mentions. This includes the original instigator rejoining. \nwrld_37443b7e-2bc5-4f1b-82e1-7c81f384b601",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
